# .clinerules

This file will contain project intelligence.

*   The Google Sign-In functionality is implemented in the `FirebaseAuthService.cs` file.
*   The `LoginGoogle` method returns the Google Sign-In URL.
*   The `SignInWithGoogleIdToken` method is not fully implemented and needs to be implemented.
*   A corresponding endpoint needs to be created in `UsersController.cs` to handle the Google Sign-In flow.
